    <DataNode elementId="AT1G67560-MONOMER" textLabel="Lipoxygenase 6, chloroplastic" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT1G67560-MONOMER" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="275" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="zhang">The Arabidopsis genome has six predicted lipoxygenases. In vitro enzyme assay indicated that AtLOX-1 and AtLOX-5 are 9S-lipoxygenases which oxygenated both linoleate and linolenate with similar activities, whereas AtLOX-2, AtLOX-3, AtLOX-4 and AtLOX-6 are 13S-lipoxygenases with preferred activities towards linolenate |CITS: [18949503]|. Gene expression analysis suggested a role in lateral root development for AtLOX-1 and ATLOX-5 |CITS: [17369372]|. The absence of wound-induced jasmonic acid accumulation in LOX2 antisense plants indicated LOX2 is required for jasmonic acid synthesis |CITS: [7567995]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT1G67560-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="AtLOX6" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-12919, RXN-12918" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="2" />
      <Property key="GOTerms" value="GO:0009507" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT1G67560.1" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT1G67560" />
      <Property key="^citations" value="15322131" />
